{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_title", "source_sha256": "4d4537a5eb021fb09efbc5bb3f2667a2c0309d1152e651ed4827305314c89bca", "ja": "真美とおでかけ2", "zh": "和真美外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d1c886be916ac2803ff065a6f3fc84c28178e6454d0d6e348bcf6f54e7629021", "ja": "真美とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和真美外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6075847437d92a999654da271d121f2fb03138acfe50d4c0995c5a4de0224c8c", "ja": "（仕事の後。真美に「行きたいところがある」と言われ\n浜辺で待ち合わせをしたのだが……）", "zh": "（工作结束后，真美说有个想去的地方，于是我们约好在海边见面，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "e61faee348a14029e2403264b3d9ae48673cca7922206383a72bd243d4505ef8", "ja": "も～、兄ちゃん遅いよ～。\n真美、待ちくたびれちゃったよ～。", "zh": "真是的～，哥你也太慢了～。\n真美都等得不耐烦了～啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5381d3193cbc95e7866d3434eb0f6ead658dae4138cabf8389ede83e4c5e2d42", "ja": "ごめんごめん、仕事が終わらなくて……。\n真美、こんな時間から、どこに行くつもりなんだ？", "zh": "对不起，对不起，工作一直没忙完……  \n真美，你打算从这个时间开始去哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "d7a857677c2570c7952e0bbacd5f9846b15edf00dbea6fdfbce6688ecf50f4fc", "ja": "それはもちろん、着いてからのお楽しみだよ～。\nんじゃレッツ、ゴー！", "zh": "那当然是要到了之后才能揭晓的惊喜啦～  \n那就出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f2100d532c570b8d23f14aff756a8c3a643fb3fbabd1732648cf5e27915cd6ba", "ja": "真美……どこまで歩くんだ？\n海岸線しか見えないんだけど……。", "zh": "真美……到底要走到哪里啊？\n我只能看到海岸线……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "ac51f83dc1361ad281949061d58e7709cafd38a174aba2e8ab20ea948054815a", "ja": "え？　目的地なんかないよ？\nだって真美、お散歩したかっただけだし。", "zh": "诶？根本就没有目的地哦？\n因为真美只是想散散步而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "54efe318ac5ec6ab02600f7a1aa24983331993a2cd0880923bc3b868b1147291", "ja": "ええっ！　そ、そうだったのか……。\nてっきり目的地があるんだとばかり……。", "zh": "诶诶！原、原来是这样啊……\n我还以为肯定是有目的地的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "ff3cb8fe32f7ffd21dd7398d86d20a7752d1538cd59716ae0c53c5cbf6a3a2f2", "ja": "まったく、兄ちゃんは女心がわかってませんなー。\nちょっとは見て気づいてよ、景色とか何かを！", "zh": "真是的，大哥你完全不懂女人心呢～\n好歹也看一下周围，察觉察觉风景之类的东西嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "014b744789ae30ae32b11fccd5156e23557ed561bc75fd56a2fbf96347ec448f", "ja": "南エリアに来てまで働きアリの兄ちゃんを、\n真美、癒やしてあげようと思ったのに～。", "zh": "都来到南部区域了，哥哥还是像个工蚁一样忙个不停，真美本来还想治愈一下你的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0484c67d51e095b31151b98217f5c73dea8643e0bc4a5478c3b0b2b9cabbf88a", "ja": "そうか……気遣ってくれてありがとうな、真美！\nおかげで、いい気分転換になったよ。", "zh": "这样啊……谢谢你还特意为我着想，真美！\n托你的福，我心情放松多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "c8d6580d3e474870a7456308a46325c7057be180847543c14636a3d53ea28ff2", "ja": "でしょ？　真美にいっぱい感謝してね！", "zh": "对吧？要好好感谢真美哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam02_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "173dac50a923ab33032aad0a180dd6d751f8946ceaa5e4562364cc2b9ae3da53", "ja": "あとけっこう歩いて疲れちゃったから、\nおんぶで帰ってもいいよ♪", "zh": "而且走了好一段路，已经累了，所以可以背我回去吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
